      "writtenOn": "2020-09-23T19:00:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that this should be removed for the production version (it would cause trouble if we later decide to enable one of these bits in OTP).  It was useful while we were debugging because we needed to clear the REV_IIN_DET bit in REG_SYS_CTRL which had previously been set accidentally.  Once the accidental set of this bit is fixed, there is no need to actively clear it.",
      "revId": "3b3e20008d1e8a8a44ed79fec1440891590e63d4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
