      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-23T19:00:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "LN9310_SYS_CTRL_LB_DELTA_2S is incorrectly set to 0x04 in ln9310.h rather than 0x20 (i.e. it wasn\u0027t shifted to align with the mask).  This explains why during the initial bringup we saw REG_SYS_CTRL being set to 0x04 (incorrectly enabling REV_IIN_DET) even though the mask (LN9310_SYS_CTRL_LB_DELTA_MASK) was set to 0x38.",
      "revId": "3b3e20008d1e8a8a44ed79fec1440891590e63d4",
